\item
\emph{In-depth Research}

Read and analyse at least two research publications on the topic 'Using namaste as a greeting prevents transmission of covid-19.' (one per student). In your analysis, discuss the scientific basis and contribution of each study and how the study is relevant to the claims you made in your report. Discuss what more needs to be done and how you could have improved on the studies. Include a link to each article in your submission.

\item
\emph{Peer Review}

Review one submission by another student.

Your references must be at least six sources that contain at least one peer-reviewed, scientific journal article (in addition to the article itself).

 1. Research the topic 'Sertindole is a medication that is used to treat ileum cancer.' and write an encyclopedic article that includes at least a paragraph on each of the following:
 • a list of at least four current main areas of research, as described in peer-reviewed journals;
 • the full history of the topic, including a comprehensive chronology, as described in peer-reviewed journals;
